oomol/oo-gamma  1.0.0 -> 1.0.1
change_type: instructions+docs   changelog: - Connects Codex to Gamma through the OOMOL `oo` CLI and server-side credential handling. - Supports creating Gamma generations from text prompts or existing templates. - Includes wait-enabled generation actions that poll until completion, failure, or timeout. - Provides read actions for generation status, result URLs, folders, and workspace themes. - Documents schema-first action usage plus setup guidance for auth, connection, and billing errors.  Source: `oomol-lab/skills@146ef20`

